#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:2
msgid "Understand the Studio Workbench"
msgstr "了解 Studio 工作台"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:4
msgid ""
"The main Studio window is a workbench. It gives different jobs their own "
"place, but they all use the same workspace and session."
msgstr "Studio 主窗口是一个工作台。不同工作各有对应区域，但它们都使用同一个工作区和会话。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:8
msgid "The main areas"
msgstr "主要区域"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:10
msgid "**Workspace sidebar**"
msgstr "**工作区侧栏**"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:11
msgid ""
"The left side lists projects and sessions. It is where you change "
"projects, create sessions, pin important sessions, and find recent, "
"running, unread, or archived work."
msgstr "左侧列出项目和会话。你可以在这里切换项目、创建会话、置顶重要会话，以及查找最近使用、运行中、未读或已归档的工作。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:15
msgid "**Conversation area**"
msgstr "**对话区域**"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:16
msgid ""
"The center shows the current session. User messages, assistant replies, "
"plans, tool calls, file changes, terminal output, approvals, and warnings"
" appear in one timeline."
msgstr "中间区域显示当前会话。用户消息、助手回复、计划、工具调用、文件变更、终端输出、审批和警告都会出现在同一条时间线中。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:20
msgid "**Composer**"
msgstr "**Composer**"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:21
msgid ""
"The composer is the input area at the bottom. It controls the workspace, "
"mode, model, reasoning effort, approval mode, additional context, and the"
" message you want to send. See :doc:`../agent/composer`."
msgstr "Composer 是底部的输入区域。它控制工作区、模式、模型、推理力度、审批模式、额外上下文以及要发送的消息。请参阅 :doc:`../agent/composer`。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:25
msgid "**Side dock**"
msgstr "**侧边停靠区**"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:26
msgid ""
"The side dock is useful for Git changes and file or browser panels. Open "
"it when you want to keep the conversation visible while inspecting a "
"result."
msgstr "侧边停靠区适合查看 Git 变更以及文件或浏览器面板。当你希望检查结果时仍保持对话可见，可以打开它。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:29
msgid "**Bottom dock**"
msgstr "**底部停靠区**"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:30
msgid ""
"The bottom dock is useful for terminal sessions. It can also host files, "
"browser panels, or the Git review panel when that arrangement suits your "
"work."
msgstr "底部停靠区适合运行终端会话。根据工作需要，它也可以承载文件、浏览器面板或 Git 审查面板。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:35
msgid "Home and session views"
msgstr "主页和会话视图"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:37
msgid ""
"When no session is selected, Studio shows a home view. It helps you "
"choose a workspace, start a session, and launch common project actions. "
"When a session is selected, the central area becomes the conversation "
"view."
msgstr "未选择会话时，Studio 会显示主页视图。你可以在这里选择工作区、启动会话和执行常用项目操作。选择会话后，中间区域会变成对话视图。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:41
msgid ""
"The session summary can show environment information, Godot information, "
"plans, and source attachments. From the summary you may also be able to "
"run the Godot project, run a selected scene, open a diff, or start a Git "
"commit action, depending on the workspace and available tools."
msgstr "会话摘要可以显示环境信息、Godot 信息、计划和源文件附件。根据工作区和可用工具，你还可能可以从摘要中运行 Godot 项目、运行选定场景、打开 diff 或启动 Git 提交操作。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:47
msgid "Panels and tabs"
msgstr "面板和标签页"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:49
msgid ""
"Use the ``+`` action in a dock to add another panel. Studio supports "
"these panel types:"
msgstr "使用停靠区中的 ``+`` 操作添加其他面板。Studio 支持以下面板类型："

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:52
msgid "**Changes** — review the Git diff for the workspace;"
msgstr "**Changes** — 审查工作区的 Git diff；"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:53
msgid "**Terminal** — run and watch a terminal process;"
msgstr "**Terminal** — 运行并观察终端进程；"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:54
msgid "**Files** — browse and edit text files;"
msgstr "**Files** — 浏览和编辑文本文件；"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Browser** — open a web page and optionally provide page context to the "
"agent."
msgstr "**Browser** — 打开网页，并可选择向 agent 提供页面上下文。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:58
msgid ""
"You can move between tabs, close tabs, resize a dock, and place a dock in"
" fullscreen. Studio remembers the arrangement for the session. A terminal"
" process is still stopped when you leave the session or restart Studio; "
"panel layout persistence does not mean process persistence."
msgstr "你可以切换标签页、关闭标签页、调整停靠区大小，或将停靠区置于全屏。Studio 会记住会话的布局。离开会话或重启 Studio 时，终端进程仍会停止；面板布局持久化不代表进程持久化。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:64
msgid "Notifications and unread work"
msgstr "通知和未读工作"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:66
msgid ""
"Studio can show a native notification when a run finishes, a Goal reaches"
" a terminal state, an approval is waiting, or a clarification is needed. "
"If you were looking at another session, the workspace tree can mark the "
"completed session as unread. Open that session and read the timeline "
"before acting on the notification alone."
msgstr "运行完成、Goal 到达终止状态、等待审批或需要澄清时，Studio 可以显示系统通知。如果你当时正在查看其他会话，工作区树可以将已完成的会话标记为未读。请打开该会话并阅读时间线，不要只根据通知采取行动。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:73
msgid "If the layout feels crowded"
msgstr "如果布局显得拥挤"

#: ../../source/workspaces/workbench.rst:75
msgid ""
"Hide the workspace sidebar, session sidebar, or bottom dock with the "
"toolbar controls or the shortcuts in :doc:`../reference/shortcuts`. You "
"can restore a panel at any time; hiding a panel does not delete its tabs "
"or its session history."
msgstr "使用工具栏控件或 :doc:`../reference/shortcuts` 中的快捷键隐藏工作区侧栏、会话侧栏或底部停靠区。你可以随时恢复面板；隐藏面板不会删除其标签页或会话历史。"
